<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 39-1 IN FIRST INNINGS V INDIA - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 39-1 IN FIRST INNINGS V INDIA - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka were 39-1 in reply to India's first innings total of 537-8 declared at close of play on the second day of the first test match in Colombo on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 1st innings 537-8 declared; Sri Lanka 39-1</p>
